title: Authorizations › New Case › Clinical documentation › Bring notes in from the EMR, a file or a screenshot
route: /authorizations/new/:draftId (step 3 of 4, the row under the drop bar)
intro: Under the drop bar sits the same import row as on Intake: Pull from EMR (only when a clinical record system is connected at a site in view), Import a file and Paste a screenshot. Here it brings documents: the chart's earlier notes, the rows of a document export, or a pasted note. They land on the checklist, where Reader reads them. A document already in the case is never replaced.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "On step 3, under the drop bar"
decision dSys "Is a clinical record system connected at a site in view?\n'Needs attention' and disconnected systems do not count"
process pNo "No 'Pull from EMR' button"
click cEmr "Click 'Pull from EMR', pick a chart, click 'Pull'"
click cFile "Click 'Import a file'\nA document export: title and date columns, one document per row"
click cShot "Click 'Paste a screenshot', or press Ctrl+V or Cmd+V\nA screenshot of a note"
goto gEmr "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Import › Pull from EMR"
goto gFile "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Import › Import a file with field mapping"
goto gShot "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Import › Paste a screenshot"
screen sRev "Review: '3 documents found'\nA box for each: 'Psychiatric evaluation · 10/18/2026'"
click cApply "Click 'Apply 3'"
decision dSlot "Does a document's title match a slot on the payer's list?"
process pSlot "It takes that slot: 'Progress note' goes to 'Therapy note from the last 14 days'"
process pExtra "It is listed as 'Not on the list'"
decision dTaken "Is that slot already filled?"
process pKeep "Kept as it is; the toast names it\n'Already in the case: Medication list.'"
agent aRead "Reader reads each new document\nThe row shows 'Reader is reading', then its checks"
toast t1 "'Applied 3 documents'\n'Pulled from Clinical record · Site A'"
process pStale "If the agents had already run, the run starts over\nBecause the records changed"
toast tStale "'Records changed after the agents ran'\n'Their work was cleared. The agents check again when you continue.'"
goto gRec "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Clinical documentation › The checklist and Continue"

s1 --> dSys
dSys -->|No| pNo
dSys -->|Yes| cEmr --> gEmr
s1 --> cFile --> gFile
s1 --> cShot --> gShot
gEmr -.-> sRev
gFile -.-> sRev
gShot -.-> sRev
sRev --> cApply --> dSlot
dSlot -->|Yes| dTaken
dSlot -->|No| pExtra --> aRead
dTaken -->|No| pSlot --> aRead
dTaken -->|Yes| pKeep --> t1
aRead --> t1 --> gRec
aRead -.-> pStale -.-> tStale
